; Supply-chain install policy for front-2 (Task M0.1).
;
; prefer-frozen-lockfile: installs honor the committed pnpm-lock.yaml whenever it
; is up to date — no silent re-resolution that could pull a tampered transitive
; version. CI installs with the stricter explicit `--frozen-lockfile`.
;
; NOTE: pnpm's `ignore-scripts` / hoisting are workspace-ROOT settings and are NOT
; honored from this per-app file. The `--ignore-scripts` lifecycle-script ban is
; therefore applied on the install COMMAND (see CI), and trusted first-party
; postinstall steps are re-run explicitly afterward.
prefer-frozen-lockfile=true
